cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If xdfem2d contributes to published work, please cite it as below. Add the version you used (xdfem2d.__version__) or the DOI of that release."
type: software
title: "xdfem2D: 2D plane frame and shell finite element analysis engine"
authors:
  - family-names: Cachim
    given-names: Paulo
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0556-1056"
    affiliation: "Universidade de Aveiro"
# DOI of the concept: covers every version and resolves to the latest release.
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23511092"
license: LGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/pcachim/xdfem2D"
url: "https://pcachim.github.io/xdfem2D"
abstract: >-
  xdfem2d is a Python library for the finite element analysis of 2D plane
  frames, walls, slabs and grillages (linear, non-linear and modal), with
  Eurocode design checks. It is released under the LGPLv3 and is also
  published on PyPI.
keywords:
  - finite element
  - structural analysis
  - eurocode
  - frames
  - slabs
  - grillages
